[0m06:35:43.537834 [debug] [Thread-1 (]: On model.mbtsa.dim_agency: /* {"app": "dbt", "dbt_version": "1.8.9", "profile_name": "mbtsa", "target_name": "dev", "node_id": "model.mbtsa.dim_agency"} */

  
    
    

